# Public-client smoke, client half: walk three towns (WORLD_SYSTEMS_PLAN I4.1). Not a filming take.
# Run by tools\release\public-smoke-client.ps1 after login, the Resident menu and the Crew window; the GM is the
# fresh database's Admin (admin/admin), in Henesys. Only stack-neutral verbs: map/warp/expectlog read the live
# server's admin port and log, so the server-side check is public-smoke.ps1 -Phase check afterwards.
say !warp 101000000
wait 5
hold right 1500
wait 2
say !warp 102000000
wait 5
hold left 1500
wait 2
say !warp 103000000
wait 5
hold right 1500
wait 2
say !warp 100000000
wait 5
